Regex rules in adblock lists and in Pi-hole style regex lists.

-- list r block adblock --
/^ad[sx]?[0-9]*\./
/TRACK(er|ing)\.example$/
@@/^ads\.safe\./
/(/
/^banner\./$important
-- list pi block regex --
# one RE2 expression per line
(\.|^)doubleclick\.net$
/^slashed\./
^pixel\.;querytype=AAAA
-- counts r --
rules=4 exceptions=1 unsupported=0 invalid=1 entries=4
-- counts pi --
rules=2 unsupported=1 invalid=0 entries=2
-- expect --
ads.example.com          block r /^ad[sx]?[0-9]*\./
ad12.example.com         block r /^ad[sx]?[0-9]*\./
bad.example.com          pass
mytracker.example        block r /TRACK(er|ing)\.example$/   # upper-case regex compiled case-insensitively
tracking.example.net     pass
ads.safe.example         allow r @@/^ads\.safe\./
banner.example           block r /^banner\./$important
doubleclick.net          block pi /(\.|^)doubleclick\.net$/
stats.doubleclick.net    block pi /(\.|^)doubleclick\.net$/
notdoubleclick.net       pass
slashed.example          block pi /^slashed\./
pixel.example            pass    # Pi-hole ;querytype= extension is unsupported
